MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- plan: kernel-created issues no longer mislabeled as "Beads". executePlan now
  returns backend-accurate `issueId` + `issueBackend`; the `forge plan` handler
  and `forge-cmd` print a backend-accurate label ("Kernel:" vs "Beads:").
  `beadsIssueId` retained as a deprecated alias of `issueId` for back-compat.
- skills-sync: populateAgentSkills pre-clears a pre-existing (possibly dangling)
  symlink at a target skill path before copying. Only symlinks are removed —
  real directories with content are never deleted.
- gitignore: corrected stale comment — agent skill dirs are real file copies
  populated at setup, not junctions/symlinks.
- docs: regenerated the D20 bd call-site kill-list artifact for shifted plan.js
  line numbers (release check: 0 blockers).
- CHANGELOG: added [Unreleased] entries.

Tests: plan, skills-sync (+2 new symlink pre-clean tests), structural drift,
setup, release-readiness all green; eslint --max-warnings 0 clean.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
